# Normalization policy (P10-S1, D1-proven in a throwaway clone):
# - normalize all text files on commit (text=auto) — no forced eol, so
#   Windows checkouts keep native CRLF and the legacy tests' rewrites stay
#   byte-identical to the committed blobs on every platform;
# - binary artifacts never normalized.
* text=auto
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
